data: {"type":"response.content_part.done","sequence_number":1521,"item_id":"msg_02a1cbcfcdff6471016b099b0af72087d191f0f5962683453d","output_index":1,"content_index":0,"part":{"type":"output_text","text":"{\"queries\":[],\"result_json\":\"{\\\"reviews\\\":[{\\\"actor\\\":\\\"lin\\\",\\\"decision\\\":\\\"develop\\\",\\\"ability\\\":null,\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Develop a general non-ingestive food-evidence assessment operation, initially limited to a practical evidence-and-method feasibility audit. Related capabilities were searched: examine-material supplies qualitative observations, consult reads records, and probe performs bounded observations or physical trials. None supplies validated toxicity assessment or evidence-scoped preparation conclusions; combining their names does not validate an assay. No validated assay, identification reference, equipment or root preparation knowledge is established here. The executable precursor must report this limitation, not infer safety from appearance or lack of observed harm. Missing assay mechanisms remain eligible for the current-conversation development handoff, not permanent rejection.\\\",\\\"specification\\\":\\\"Operation: assess-food-evidence(target, specimen, mode, evidenceRefs, methodRef?, equipmentRefs?, quantity?). General to accessible food specimens, with modes assess and execute-validated-method sharing one evidence pipeline. Initial executable mode is assess; execution is enabled only for an actually implemented, validated non-ingestive protocol whose contract supplies its prerequisites, costs, detection limits, controls, hazards and disposal rules. No tasting, ingestion, uncontrolled skin exposure or invented universal edibility test. Do not implement an empty success-producing trial mode.\\\\nPrerequisites and exact scope: identify an accessible target and unit, and references actually accessible to the actor. Lin's initial target may be commons-root-0-0, unit 1, in place. The prior traits reference commons-root-0-0:unit-1:traits is a four-part paged record; the supplied fragment is incomplete and must not be parsed as a complete record or treated as evidence for omitted properties. commons-root-0-0:observed-state is explicitly unverified and concerns source condition, not food safety. berry knowledge concerns berries only, not roots. Neither owned berry stack is a reagent or control. Darkness precludes new visual identification; a visual requiring light must wait for actual light. Source labels, stock, coordinates and simulation internals cannot establish identity or toxicity. No hidden resource properties are read or disclosed.\\\\nInputs and costs: study takes 2 individually completed rounds at 0.2 energy each. An assessment takes 1 active round and 0.2 energy, examining one specimen against a bounded supplied set of at most four complete evidence references and one candidate method. Validate accessibility and reference completeness before charging; malformed or inaccessible inputs are refused free. An accessible specimen with no valid evidence or method is a valid paid assessment yielding a limitation report. It consumes, moves and reserves zero food, tools, reagents or water. Additional reading uses consult at its existing 1-round, 0.2-energy contract; additional physical inspection uses examine-material at its existing learning and execution costs and prerequisites. These are separate actions, not free observations hidden inside assessment. Travel, obtaining light, gathering and communications are separate. Material and trial energy costs cannot be invented now: execution remains unavailable until an exact validated method defines numerical quantities, duration and risks before commitment.\\\\nEffects and products: create a personal assessment record and observable completion event referencing actor, target, unit, evidence IDs and versions, candidate protocol, conditions, time, applicability checks, provenance and limitations. Keep direct observations, validated findings, unverified claims and unknowns separate. Report toxicity, edibility and preparation requirements independently. Each finding names exactly the tested hazard or preparation claim, method scope, detection limit and uncertainty when supported; absence of a result is not a negative result. A negative assay for one hazard never proves general edibility. Preparation guidance requires an applicable validated reference; no recipe or detoxification efficacy is guessed. For Lin's currently supplied evidence the supported result is: no validated non-ingestive method established among supplied accessible evidence; toxicity, edibility and preparation requirements remain unknown. List concrete unmet prerequisites: applicable validated identification/reference or assay protocol, and its actually required equipment, controls, safe conditions and materials. Do not assert that such a method cannot exist. A later protocol proposal enters this same development handoff with its real mechanism, not a fixed-era unlock or invented activity roadmap.\\\\nConservation and lifecycle: assessment leaves the in-place unit and source stock unchanged. For any future executable assay, debit only explicit real sample/reagent quantities, track remaining sample, products, residues and waste, conserve material through transfers and transformations, and report energy inputs and dissipation. Obtain required actor authorization through actual actions; never fabricate consent or another participant's contribution. Establish numeric per-step costs and outputs before enabling that method. Initial audit commits atomically at round completion: interrupted work spends only elapsed effort and produces no completed assessment; retry is a new paid assessment. Completed records persist; unfinished drafts are not findings. Cancel is free and grants no refund of spent time or energy. Death stops work without completion or refund; existing world items remain under ordinary death rules. No continuing process, reservation or maintenance is introduced by the audit. Findings remain historical and become inapplicable when specimen identity, condition or evidence dependencies change; no automatic revalidation. Future multi-step protocols require serialized progress, safe interruption/resume, explicit consumed versus unconsumed inputs, release of unused reservations on cancel/death, and no duplication or refund of consumed inputs.\\\\nImplementation dependencies: reuse and record consult/open.consult revision foundation-open@1 for reading, probe/open.probe revision foundation-open@1 only for supported safe observations, and examine-material equivalence measurement:material-specimen:nondestructive-examination:1 for actual inspections. Record reused code and contracts as dependencies, not reinventions. This operation adds evidence applicability and bounded conclusion handling, not new sensory or chemical powers. Compile validation, accounting, stale-reference checks and result gating into code; established rules must not require repeated model review. Development/review waiting advances no world time and grants no mastery, inventory or permissions.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":2,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"No experience or pleasure for requesting, querying, naming, registration, study completion, mastery, or simply emitting this report. A genuinely new verified observation or informative executed failure may qualify only through an observable evidence event applicable to Lin; merely finding no supplied method earns none by default. If the existing experience engine supports such qualifying events, deduplicate by underlying specimen-state, method and finding across consult/probe/examine/assessment, not by interface name. Bound any award to one qualifying event per unchanged evidence state with at least the existing 10-round window between awards; maintained satisfaction remains subject to the existing rate 0.04 and decay 0.002, with no extra reward account or cap expansion. Familiar legitimate practice may support only the engine's modest event-backed benefit, not repeated empty audits. No physical comfort is supplied; its global cap remains 10. Nutrition, protected reward accounts, budgets, goals and permissions are unchanged.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Emit reusable assessment-event metadata: operation, actor, target and specimen reference, mode, progress, evidence references, conditions, result status and uncertainty. Use distinct pending, interrupted, blocked, inconclusive and evidence-supported states. For this case show an inconclusive/unknown finding with darkness and missing-method limitations, never a safe-food badge, completed assay animation or preparation-success effect. Prior observations may be referenced but not rendered as newly seen details in darkness. No phantom tools, reagents, samples or stock appear; failed or incomplete work cannot display success.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}}

