A negative assay for one hazard never proves general edibility. Preparation guidance requires an applicable validated reference; no recipe or detoxification efficacy is guessed. For Lin's currently supplied evidence the supported result is: no validated non-ingestive method established among supplied accessible evidence; toxicity, edibility and preparation requirements remain unknown. List concrete unmet prerequisites: applicable validated identification/reference or assay protocol, and its actually required equipment, controls, safe conditions and materials. Do not assert that such a method cannot exist. A later protocol proposal enters this same development handoff with its real mechanism, not a fixed-era unlock or invented activity roadmap.\\\\nConservation and lifecycle: assessment leaves the in-place unit and source stock unchanged. For any future executable assay, debit only explicit real sample/reagent quantities, track remaining sample, products, residues and waste, conserve material through transfers and transformations, and report energy inputs and dissipation. Obtain required actor authorization through actual actions; never fabricate consent or another participant's contribution. Establish numeric per-step costs and outputs before enabling that method. Initial audit commits atomically at round completion: interrupted work spends only elapsed effort and produces no completed assessment; retry is a new paid assessment. Completed records persist; unfinished drafts are not findings. Cancel is free and grants no refund of spent time or energy. Death stops work without completion or refund; existing world items remain under ordinary death rules. No continuing process, reservation or maintenance is introduced by the audit. Findings remain historical and become inapplicable when specimen identity, condition or evidence dependencies change; no automatic revalidation. Future multi-step protocols require serialized progress, safe interruption/resume, explicit consumed versus unconsumed inputs, release of unused reservations on cancel/death, and no duplication or refund of consumed inputs.\\\\nImplementation dependencies: reuse and record consult/open.consult revision foundation-open@1 for reading, probe/open.probe revision foundation-open@1 only for supported safe observations, and examine-material equivalence measurement:material-specimen:nondestructive-examination:1 for actual inspections. Record reused code and contracts as dependencies, not reinventions. This operation adds evidence applicability and bounded conclusion handling, not new sensory or chemical powers. Compile validation, accounting, stale-reference checks and result gating into code; established rules must not require repeated model review. Development/review waiting advances no world time and grants no mastery, inventory or permissions.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":2,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"No experience or pleasure for requesting, querying, naming, registration, study completion, mastery, or simply emitting this report. A genuinely new verified observation or informative executed failure may qualify only through an observable evidence event applicable to Lin; merely finding no supplied method earns none by default. If the existing experience engine supports such qualifying events, deduplicate by underlying specimen-state, method and finding across consult/probe/examine/assessment, not by interface name. Bound any award to one qualifying event per unchanged evidence state with at least the existing 10-round window between awards; maintained satisfaction remains subject to the existing rate 0.04 and decay 0.002, with no extra reward account or cap expansion. Familiar legitimate practice may support only the engine's modest event-backed benefit, not repeated empty audits. No physical comfort is supplied; its global cap remains 10. Nutrition, protected reward accounts, budgets, goals and permissions are unchanged.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Emit reusable assessm